{"series":{"id":"divine-love-deep-blue","slug":"divine-love-deep-blue","title":"Divine Love Deep Blue","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2026-01/008ho0oqly1i6f73uim80j35m735she3.jpg?itok=ZXCFWK6j","synopsis":"La historia se desarrolla en un mundo de hadas paralelo al humano, gobernado por la Reina Mandora. Al ver cómo los humanos destruyen el medio ambiente, Mandora decide invadir el mundo humano y convertir a todos en sus esclavos para restaurar el equilibrio natural.Para detenerla, las hadas Ye Luoli viajan al mundo humano, aunque están bajo una maldición que las convertiría en marionetas sin vida. Para sobrevivir, deben elegir compañeros humanos y firmar contratos mágicos. Así Wang Mo, Chen Sisi, Shu Yan, Jianpeng y Feng Yinsha consiguieron hadas Ye Luoli y abrieron sus propios destinos diferentes.Dirigido al Público de Chicas 🧚👩‍❤️‍👨👸💖","status":"En Emisión","year":2025,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/divine-love-deep-blue"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T16:29:34.807Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"divine-love-deep-blue-t1","slug":"divine-love-deep-blue-t1","seriesId":"divine-love-deep-blue","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2026-01/008ho0oqly1i6f73uim80j35m735she3.jpg?itok=ZXCFWK6j","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T12:19:24.523Z","episodeCount":20}],"episodes":[{"id":"divine-love-deep-blue-t1-e20","slug":"divine-love-deep-blue-t1-e20","title":"divine-love-deep-blue-1-episodio-x20","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/divine-love-deep-blue-1-episodio-x20","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v76dc5g/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true},{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k1YTMUBqxhJvDXFyFvC","embed":true}],"seriesId":"divine-love-deep-blue","seasonId":"divine-love-deep-blue-t1","number":20,"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T14:00:16.695Z"},{"id":"divine-love-deep-blu